":533},[534,535,536],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":543,\"_88\":-7},{\"_75\":179,\"_26\":538,\"_79\":539},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":537,\"_88\":-7},\" for Voice settings, Chat Voice limits, retention, and data controls.\",\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001274\",[540],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":541,\"_88\":542},\"ChatGPT Voice\",[249],\"Only one Voice conversation can run at a time. See \",[545,546],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":552,\"_88\":-7},{\"_75\":179,\"_26\":547,\"_79\":548},\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/features/voice\",[549],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":550,\"_88\":551},\"Learn more about desktop Voice.\",[249],\"In the desktop app, connected Voice time is metered separately where flexible pricing applies; tasks started through Voice draw from the same shared agentic usage and credit pool as Work and Codex. \",[554],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":555,\"_88\":-7},\"On web and mobile, Voice in Work uses minutes from your daily Voice allowance. Work tasks follow the same pricing whether you start them by speaking or typing.\",[557],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":558,\"_88\":-7},\"On web and mobile, if an action needs your approval, review and approve or decline it using the on-screen controls. Spoken approval is not supported.\",[560],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":561,\"_88\":-7},\"Voice uses the tools and permissions available to the selected experience. In managed workspaces, Voice in Work requires both Voice and Work access. Plugins retain their existing app access, data permissions, and action restrictions.\",[563],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":564,\"_88\":-7},\"Permissions and usage\",[566,567],{\"_75\":89,\"_90\":91,\"_92\":-7,\"_79\":589},{\"_75\":483,\"_350\":568},[569,570,571,572],[585],[581],[577],[573],{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":574},[575],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":576,\"_88\":-7},\"Begin speaking. You can interrupt naturally, follow the live text in the chat, and ask Voice to start or coordinate tasks.\",{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":578},[579],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":580,\"_88\":-7},\"Allow microphone access when prompted. Computer context may also require Screen \u0026 Audio Recording and Accessibility permissions.\",{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":582},[583],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":584,\"_88\":-7},\"Select the Voice control, or use a shortcut you configured in Settings.\",{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":586},[587],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":588,\"_88\":-7},\"Open the ChatGPT desktop app and choose Work or Codex.\",[590],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":591,\"_88\":-7},\"In the desktop app\",[593,594,595],{\"_75\":89,\"_90\":91,\"_92\":-7,\"_79\":602},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":599},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":596},[597],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":598,\"_88\":-7},\"You can ask Work to use connected apps, create documents, presentations, and spreadsheets, or use a browser. Follow written responses and task results in the chat. If a task is still running when you end the call, Work can continue it in text.\",[600],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":601,\"_88\":-7},\"Open ChatGPT and choose Work, then select the Voice control to start a Live conversation. Allow microphone access if prompted.\",[603],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":604,\"_88\":-7},\"On web or mobile\",[606],{\"_75\":89,\"_90\":231,\"_92\":-7,\"_79\":607},[608],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":609,\"_88\":-7},\"Use Voice with Work or Codex\",[611,612,613,614,615,616,617,618,619],{\"_75\":89,\"_90\":231,\"_92\":-7,\"_79\":661},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":658},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":655},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":652},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":649},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":641},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":634},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":627},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":620},[621,622],{\"_75\":179,\"_26\":538,\"_79\":624},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":623,\"_88\":-7},\" is available in Work on web, iOS, and Android, and in Work and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app on macOS and Windows.\",[625],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":541,\"_88\":626},[249],[628,629,630],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":633,\"_88\":-7},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":138,\"_88\":632},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":631,\"_88\":-7},\" tab in the ChatGPT mobile app. Remote access to a desktop task is separate from running a task in a cloud environment, and it does not add those desktop chats to your web or mobile chat history.\",[140],\"You can access supported desktop Codex chats from the \",[635,636,637],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":640,\"_88\":-7},{\"_75\":179,\"_26\":195,\"_79\":638},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":178,\"_88\":-7},[639],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":198,\"_88\":-7},\"Codex Cloud runs coding tasks on OpenAI-managed computers, so tasks can continue while your computer is asleep. Create and publish a cloud environment on desktop or web before selecting it for a mobile task. For plan availability and usage, see: \",[642,643,644],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":648,\"_88\":-7},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":646,\"_88\":647},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":645,\"_88\":-7},\" from the top-left menu. Its history remains separate from ChatGPT history. Codex can work with local folders, repositories, terminals, and developer tools.\",\"Codex\",[140],\"Codex remains a separate view in the ChatGPT desktop app. Select \",[650],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":651,\"_88\":-7},\"Cloud Work chats sync across web, mobile, and desktop. Work chats started on web or mobile appear in the desktop app, and cloud Work chats started on desktop can be continued on web or mobile. Local chats run on your computer. Messages and task context may be stored in the cloud, even when work runs locally.\",[653],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":654,\"_88\":-7},\"Work on web and mobile runs in the cloud. In the desktop app, select ChatGPT from the top-left menu, then select Work from the toggle at the top of the page. Chat and Work chats appear together in Recents, where you can sort, filter, and pin chats. Your existing ChatGPT Projects appear under Projects. From a project, choose Chat to start a new chat, or choose Work to start a Work chat using the project’s context. When allowed by your plan and workspace, Work in the desktop app can also use local files and desktop apps with your permission.\",[656],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":657,\"_88\":-7},\"Work is available for eligible ChatGPT Enterprise and Edu workspaces with Enterprise Key Management (EKM) enabled. For eligible workspaces, Work is enabled by default for members who use the default workspace role unless a workspace owner or admin turns it off, and Workspace settings and role-based access controls continue to determine each member’s access.\",[659],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":660,\"_88\":-7},\"Work is available on ChatGPT web and mobile for eligible paid plans. Work is also available in the ChatGPT desktop app when included for your plan and workspace.\",[662],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":663,\"_88\":-7},\"Where Work and Codex are available\",[665,666],{\"_75\":89,\"_90\":231,\"_92\":-7,\"_79\":700},{\"_75\":483,\"_350\":667},[668,669,670,671],[693],[686],[679],[672],{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":673},[674,675],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":677,\"_88\":678},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":676,\"_88\":-7},\": Talk naturally with Work on web or mobile, or with Work or Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app, and ask it to work on a task.\",\"Voice\",[140],{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":680},[681,682],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":684,\"_88\":685},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":683,\"_88\":-7},\" Write or debug code, run tests and commands, review changes, or work with a repository.\",\"Codex:\",[140],{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":687},[688,689],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":691,\"_88\":692},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":690,\"_88\":-7},\" Research a topic, analyze information, or create a document, spreadsheet, presentation, report, or Site.\",\"Work:\",[140],{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":694},[695,696],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":698,\"_88\":699},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":697,\"_88\":-7},\" Ask questions, search, brainstorm, or get quick conversational help.\",\"Chat:\",[140],[701],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":702,\"_88\":-7},\"Choose an experience\",[704,705,706,707,708,709,710],{\"_75\":89,\"_90\":231,\"_92\":-7,\"_79\":769},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":766},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":763},{\"_75\":483,\"_350\":746},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":743},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":736},{\"_75\":83,\"_79\":711},[712,713,714,715,716,717,718],{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":735,\"_88\":-7},{\"_75\":179,\"_26\":730,\"_79\":731},{\"_75\":86,\"_86\":729,\"_88\":-7},{\